*utime* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''utime(path, atime, mtime)''

Sets the ''a''ccess and ''m''odification ''time''stamps of the file or directory at ''path'', following symbolic links.

*Parameters:*
- ''path'': String path to the file or directory
- ''atime'': Number Unix timestamp of last access time
- ''mtime'': Number Unix timestamp of last modification time

*Returns:*
- ''ok'' on success
- ''err'' on failure
